## Fixed

**0.4.0 has no image.** Its release published the npm packages, but the image build stopped. The image `ghcr.io/micacms/mica:0.4.0` does not exist. Use `ghcr.io/micacms/mica:0.4.1`. It is the first image with a signature, an SBOM and build provenance.

Read the notes for [0.4.0](/changelog/) before you upgrade from 0.3.0. The Breaking changes there also apply to 0.4.1.
